# GMS throws it in two parts: 400+8x% at one enemy, and on striking them a
# detonation of 45+3x% six times over six. The detonation is the swing here
# and the opening throw is its lead hit -- see fight.h. Folding the two into
# one column would have handed the bystanders a shuriken only the target takes.
#
# The Assassin's only attack, so it carries no cooldown: the pair the wizards
# alternate between is what a cooldown is for, and there is no pair here.
#
# Two enemies against GMS's six. The detonation's own box is 200x220 -- a burst
# at the struck monster's feet, wide enough for it and one neighbour, whatever
# GMS lets it count. See Skill.max_enemies.
name: "Shuriken Burst"
skill_order: 1
description:
  "Throw exploding shurikens that ricochet to nearby enemies on hit. "
  "Shurikens detonate when they hit their first enemy."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ASSASSIN
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base_delay_ms: 720
max_enemies: 2
lines: 6
lead_lines: 1
base {
  skill_pct: 0.48
  lead_pct: 4.08
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.03
  lead_pct: 0.08
}
